<%- meetup = talk["meetup"] -%>
# <%= talk["title"] %>

By <%= talk["speaker"] %>, <%= site.upcoming?(meetup) ? "coming up at" : "given at" %> [Berlin.rb #<%= meetup["number"] %>](<%= site.markdown_url(site.meetup_path(meetup)) %>) on <%= site.long_date(meetup["date"]) %><%= " at #{meetup["venue"]}" if meetup["venue"] %>.

- Page: <%= Berlinrb::Site::ORIGIN %><%= site.talk_path(talk) %>
<%- if talk["video"] -%>
- Recording: <%= site.video_url(talk["video"]) %>
<%- end -%>
<%- if talk["slides"] -%>
- Slides: <%= Berlinrb::Site::ORIGIN %><%= talk["slides"] %>
<%- end -%>
<%- unless talk["abstract"].to_s.empty? -%>

## About the talk

<%= talk["abstract"].strip %>
<%- end -%>
<%- if (summary = site.summary_markdown(talk)) -%>

<%= summary %>

The chapters and summary were written with AI from the recording, then checked by Berlin.rb and <%= talk["speaker"] %>.
<%- end -%>
